{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1000_p", "source_sha256": "297c67adc999335c0dbdedbdb776f30c388f34f47af872c95e0a759a66a340b6", "ja": "（育達が出演する映画の撮影も、そろそろ佳境だ。\nみんな、いい演技だったな……！）", "zh": "（育她们出演的电影也差不多要拍到最精彩的部分了。大家的演技都很棒啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4cb118b389f800b66f2437756c3be06fd4c6a8470be571ff8c0d5b235fd4badd", "ja": "お疲れ様、育。さっきのクライマックスシーン、\n思わず見入っちゃったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，育。刚才的高潮戏份，我不知不觉看入迷了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "c63b060636d951143ca26f6e308ef343bfd2e8391584fdb6714c95231ed3931a", "ja": "ほんとう？　上手にできてた？", "zh": "真的吗？我演得好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1003_p", "source_sha256": "18fcf94b20d6c1f4508c8ce7ca869a1b985b25cdda08325ce419e37540f591d4", "ja": "ああ。特に別れのシーンとか……育の演じる\nわかばの切ない気持ちが、すごく伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "嗯，尤其是离别的场景……育饰演的若叶那份难过的心情，传达得非常到位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "6caf2f3dcf87a075d48f78f9a893157ec84cf7cca5f081660da545be518c217b", "ja": "よかった～。なかなかうまくいかないところも\nあったから、だいじょうぶかなって思ってたんだ。", "zh": "太好了～。因为有些地方总演不好，\n我还担心能不能行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2feffc35a756227db5b9006d37e823dead50b6b99f28505ea4528669270e7edb", "ja": "何度かやり直してたもんな。そういえばあの時、\n桃子からアドバイスをもらってたみたいだけど。", "zh": "你当时重来过好几次吧。对了，我记得那时候你好像还得到了桃子的建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "e9f4a9cb76912b7f8ef48969eb98acd9463a61c7566c25089a383ed7dfa703bd", "ja": "うん！　……あのね、大好きなお姉ちゃんと\nお別れするって、すっごく悲しいことでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！……那个，和最喜欢的姐姐分别，是一件非常难过的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "06d7af7310f439aa8d048e70d0c5ee0a6265e5c95831f6e3bd84f93e13eea6be", "ja": "わたし、大好きな人と\nお別れしたこと、ないから……。", "zh": "我从来没有和最喜欢的人\n分别过，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6cc5537f91eb36adf63693dbb89e8e4a4104e5af9932764cbccdeb8bd365df86", "ja": "そうだな、あまり経験したくはない事だけど。\n実際に経験があるほうが、イメージはしやすいな。", "zh": "是啊，虽然那是不太想经历的事。\n但有过实际经历的话，确实更容易想象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "e7b8c9e1c45463f07c8bf79c9928163734d16640ab085131fd9eab9a6d10d4bd", "ja": "うん……そしたら桃子ちゃんがね、\n「そういう時は、もしもを想像すればいいよ」って。", "zh": "嗯……然后桃子就对我说：\n“那种时候，只要想象一下‘如果’就好了”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "0987ece435f767a95cf12e9ac176a702c77447ee23219ad3c4fdf5fbb4bfd54f", "ja": "だからわたし、もしも{$P$}さんと\nお別れすることになったらって、想像したの。", "zh": "所以我就想象了一下，如果有一天要和{$P$}先生分别的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "d56e04c19f3c5a02faaa09b47a6b55d309da760d82c15f98c3dd44404903b9db", "ja": "そしたらね、すごく、すっごく悲しくなって……。\nわかばの気持ち、すこしわかった気がしたんだ。", "zh": "然后啊，我就变得特别、特别难过……。\n感觉自己好像稍微明白了一点若叶的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8d14308796c7d009cfe14959ddacbc81389221c2aca5b40040fe24f68f048d15", "ja": "桃子が、そんな事を……そうか。\nでも本当に、いいお芝居だったよ。", "zh": "桃子竟然会那样……这样啊。\n不过，你的表演真的很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "066b9beda06ddb088511a16a2d5d7e4c7b9ea33f6f23fdafbb4e8f8c5d951d1d", "ja": "うん。でも、上手にできたのはよかったんだけど……\nそのあとも、悲しい気持ちがなかなか消えないんだ。", "zh": "嗯。不过，虽然能顺利演好是件好事……\n可那之后，悲伤的心情一直都很难消散。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "222913046dc19d6ee728d43b0ab4e9c93024bddf1d6e7b03af99053a9b3162c5", "ja": "もし本当に、{$P$}さんと\nお別れすることになったらどうしようって。", "zh": "要是真的不得不和{$P$}先生\n分开了，该怎么办呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "3284c930278dcb36d31747513678611391355a14aac523012a15c7632ecb5df7", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\n突然いなくなっちゃったり、しないよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生不会突然消失不见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_1016", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_2000_p", "source_sha256": "664de877f6164aeff36795110195f4f2317082941b695c9eccb4f3736f630ee5", "ja": "もちろん。これからも育のそばにいるよ。\n何と言っても、育のプロデューサーなんだからな。", "zh": "当然了。今后我也会一直陪在育身边的。\n毕竟我可是育的制作人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_2001_030iku", "source_sha256": "76f0288acd9423da5c1f9d888ce0f416fff69576eba7f4535bc5105f6dd63062", "ja": "そっか……えへへ、そうだよね！", "zh": "这样啊……嘿嘿，说得对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0424_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "53721a2828a9c8da1695cd5f21cf2a4648357005c0c4cb74c39b7ef739abdcf5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、これからも\nずーっといてくれなくちゃダメだからね。約束だよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今后也要一直一直陪着我才行哦。约好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
